flowchart LR
    A[Instance JSON] --> B[Catalog features]
    B --> C[Grid model + cutter footprint]
    C --> D{partition?}
    D -- no --> W[one walk: lane segments + ILS order]
    W --> S[split into k pieces, close each]
    D -- bands-x / bands-y --> P[k bands, one tour each, rebalance]
    S --> F[prune: cut corners while covered]
    P --> F
    F --> G{official verifier}
    G -- errors --> X[discard + log]
    G -- feasible --> H[candidate store]
    H --> I[best per instance]
    C --> L[lower bound]
    L --> R[leaderboard: gap to bound]
    I --> R
